// P3G.5 ER Ex2 "Moving Elements to Another Document" (external-references.md ER8 steps 1–7,
// ER8.check; ex2-step1.png … ex2-step7.png) on the stand-in `fixtures/move_to_document_standin.cadrs`
// ("Exercise: Move to Document": Hexapod, Pneumatic Piston, Piston Assembly, Topplate,
// Baseplate; the ER Ex1 geometry at V1, all same-document workspace references;
// `cadrs_core::samples::piston::move_to_document`).
// 01 (ER8.1) the documents page: the exercise's menu, Copy… hovered.
// 02 (ER8.1) the Copy dialog: "Copy of Exercise: Move to Document".
// 03 the copy opened on the Hexapod: Baseplate <1>, Topplate <1>, Piston Assembly <1>–<6>; five
//    tabs.
// 04 (ER8.2) the Piston Assembly tab's menu: Move to document… hovered.
// 05 (ER8.3) the dialog: New document "Pneumatic Piston", "2 referenced tabs will be moved",
//    "Moving 2 tabs to Pneumatic Piston", Move hovered.
// 06 (ER8.4) moved: the six Piston Assembly rows show the version icon; only Hexapod, Topplate
//    and Baseplate are left; the toast.
// 07 the Hexapod's mass properties, unchanged: 589 534.041 mm³, centroid (0, 0, 50.348).
// 08 (ER8.5) the documents page, Created by me, sorted by name: the new "Pneumatic Piston".
// 09 (ER8.6) Pneumatic Piston opened: its tabs Pneumatic Piston and Piston Assembly.
// 10 (ER8.7, ER8.check) Piston Assembly, all instances, Mass properties: 10³ + 60π·7.8625² +
//    9π·28 + 8³ = 13 956.271 mm³, centroid (0, 0, 32.263); Aluminum 6061: 0.038 kg (37.682 g).
Scenario(
    start: Some("document"),
    steps: [
        WaitFor("document-shell"),
        Wait(20),
        Custom("linked-fixture store move_to_document_standin"),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("back-to-documents")),
        WaitFor("landing"),
        Wait(20),
        Click(ui("search-field")),
        Wait(3),
        Type("Move to Document"),
        Wait(20),
        RightClick(ui("doc-name-0")),
        WaitFor("ctx-copy"),
        Wait(5),
        Hover(ui("ctx-copy")),
        Wait(10),
        Screenshot("01-documents-copy"),
        Click(ui("ctx-copy")),
        WaitFor("copy-dialog"),
        Wait(10),
        Screenshot("02-copy-dialog"),
        Key("Enter"),
        Wait(20),
        Custom("move-doc open Copy of Exercise: Move to Document"),
        WaitFor("document-shell"),
        Wait(60),
        Click(ui("tab-hexapod")),
        Wait(60),
        Key("F"),
        Wait(40),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("03-copy-hexapod"),
        RightClick(ui("tab-piston-assembly")),
        WaitFor("tab-context-menu"),
        Wait(5),
        Hover(ui("tab-move")),
        Wait(20),
        Screenshot("04-tab-menu-move"),
        Click(ui("tab-move")),
        WaitFor("move-to-document-dialog"),
        Wait(10),
        Key("Ctrl+A"),
        Type("Pneumatic Piston"),
        Wait(10),
        Hover(ui("move-confirm")),
        Wait(20),
        Screenshot("05-move-dialog"),
        Click(ui("move-confirm")),
        Wait(90),
        Key("F"),
        Wait(30),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("06-moved"),
        Click(ui("instance-root")),
        Wait(3),
        Click(ui("view-mass")),
        WaitFor("mass-dialog"),
        Wait(10),
        ExpectText("mass-dialog", "589534.041"),
        ExpectText("mass-dialog", "50.348"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("07-hexapod-mass"),
        Click(ui("mass-dialog-cancel")),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("back-to-documents")),
        WaitFor("landing"),
        Wait(20),
        Click(ui("filter-created")),
        Wait(30),
        // Sorted by name: documents made in the same minute would otherwise be ordered by
        // their (random) ids.
        Click(ui("col-name")),
        Wait(20),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("08-created-by-me"),
        Custom("move-doc open Pneumatic Piston"),
        WaitFor("document-shell"),
        Wait(60),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("09-new-document"),
        Click(ui("tab-piston-assembly")),
        Wait(40),
        Key("F"),
        Wait(30),
        Click(ui("instance-root")),
        Wait(3),
        Click(ui("view-mass")),
        WaitFor("mass-dialog"),
        Wait(10),
        ExpectText("mass-dialog", "13956.271"),
        ExpectText("mass-dialog", "32.263"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("10-piston-mass"),
    ],
)
